'''Walkatrout'''<ref name="TFC"/> is the [[Omnitrix]]'s DNA sample of a [[Ickthyperambuloid (Classic)|Ickthyperambuloid]]{{Refn|[[:File:Ickthyperambuloid Proof.png]]|group = DJW}} from the planet [[Gilli-Perambulous Promenade]].{{Refn|[[:File:Gilli-Perambulous Promenade Proof.PNG]]|group = DJW}}

==Appearance==
Walkatrout is a small, blue fish-like alien with stubby fins for arms, a shark-like dorsal fin, and a pair of thin, spindly legs jutting from his underside. He has a wide mouth with an underbite, and gills on his cheeks with bulging green eyes.

Walkatrout wears a green belt-like strap around his "waist" and back, with the [[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|Omnitrix]] symbol connecting the front.
