==Powers and Abilities==
<gallery type="slideshow" widths="300">
OB (337).png|Slippery Body
IaMBW1 (117).png|Enhanced Durability
OB (323.1).png|Enhanced Acrobatics
TFC (415).png|Underwater Breathing
</gallery>
Walkatrout has a slippery body, making him hard to grab<ref>[[Speedyquick]]</ref><ref name="IaMMMBWP1" /> and allowing him to slide on the [[Plumber Headquarters (Omniverse)|Plumber HQ]] floor.<ref name="Outbreak">''[[Outbreak]]''</ref> With the help of other people, Walkatrout can even slide through cramped spaces, such as the pipes of toilets.<ref name="TFC" />

Walkatrout has a degree of enhanced durability, as is shown when he was knocked onto the ground along with [[Speedyquick]] without serious damage.<ref name="IaMMMBWP1" />

Walkatrout is somewhat acrobatic, as he can perform cartwheels.<ref name="Outbreak" />

Walkatrout has gills and can breathe underwater.<ref name="TFC">''[[The Final Countdown]]''</ref>

==Weaknesses==
[[File:OB (323).png|thumb|Small Size]]
Walkatrout is very small and just not suited for combat generally, giving him a disadvantage against larger opponents, or any opponent in general. He is only as tall as a [[Vaxasaurian (Classic)|Vaxasaurian]]'s foot.<ref name="Outbreak"/>

==History==
===Omniverse===
*Walkatrout first appeared in ''[[Outbreak]]'', where he was accidentally unlocked by [[Blukic]] and [[Driba]] when they tried to fix the Omnitrix. After escaping from [[Liam]], Blukic and Driba switched him into [[Pesky Dust]].
*In ''[[Charm School]]'', Ben accidentally transformed into Walkatrout and was disappointed.
*In ''[[Fight at the Museum]]'', Walkatrout failed to escape the exhibit room he and [[Kai Green|Kai]] were trapped in.
*In ''[[It's a Mad, Mad, Mad Ben World: Part 1]]'', Walkatrout traveled to [[Bellwood (Classic)|Bellwood]] with [[Speedyquick]]'s help.
*In ''[[The Final Countdown]]'', Walkatrout got in the locked [[Plumber Headquarters (Omniverse)|Plumber HQ]] through the toilet.
*In ''[[A New Dawn]]'', Walkatrout appeared for a short time when [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] was cycling through his aliens.

