==Etymology==
Walkatrout's name is derived from "walk about" and "[[Wikipedia:Trout|trout]]", the latter of which is the common name for a number of certain species of freshwater fish.

==Trivia==
*The design for Walkatrout came from [[Gil Steptoe]], drawn by [[Steven Choi]] or [[Chap Yaep]].{{Refn|[[:File:Steve or Chap Gil.png]]|group = DJW}}{{Refn|[[:File:Steven and Chap Came Up With Outbreak Aliens.png]]|group = DJW}}
*Walkatrout's name was coined by Driba;<ref name="Outbreak" /> Ben starts using that name in ''[[An American Benwolf in London]]''.
*Walkatrout is one of four aliens unlocked by [[Driba]] and [[Blukic]]; the other three being [[Pesky Dust]], [[Mole-Stache]], and [[The Worst]].<ref name="Outbreak" />
**Of the 4, he’s the only one who’s still voiced by [[Yuri Lowenthal]] after their debut, as the other 3 had their voices changed.
*A running gag with both him and The Worst is that Ben tends to turn into them during inopportune moments, much like [[Grey Matter (Classic)|Grey Matter]].
*[[Albedo]] is unable to transform into Walkatrout.{{Refn|[[:File:Albedo Does Not Have Outbreak Aliens.png]]|group = DJW}}
**Despite this, [[Derrick J. Wyatt]] drew some art of Negative Walkatrout in 2020, which can be found in the [[Walkatrout/Gallery|gallery]].{{Refn|[[:File:Negative Walkatrout Proof.png]]|group = DJW}}

